{"audio": "galatians-05.opus", "duration_ms": 172956, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2060, "end_ms": 3520, "text": "Galatians, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 4920, "end_ms": 7501, "text": "It is for freedom that Christ has set us free."}, {"start_ms": 7921, "end_ms": 12081, "text": "Stand firm, then, and do not be encumbered once more by a yoke of slavery."}, {"start_ms": 12561, "end_ms": 19782, "text": "Take notice: I, Paul, tell you that if you let yourselves be circumcised, Christ will be of no value to you at all."}, {"start_ms": 20582, "end_ms": 26362, "text": "Again I testify to every man who gets himself circumcised that he is obligated to obey the whole law."}, {"start_ms": 27163, "end_ms": 32983, "text": "You who are trying to be justified by the law have been severed from Christ; you have fallen away from grace."}, {"start_ms": 33763, "end_ms": 37803, "text": "But by faith we eagerly await through the Spirit the hope of righteousness."}, {"start_ms": 38444, "end_ms": 43184, "text": "For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision nor uncircumcision has any value."}, {"start_ms": 43904, "end_ms": 46544, "text": "What matters is faith expressing itself through love."}, {"start_ms": 47364, "end_ms": 48524, "text": "You were running so well."}, {"start_ms": 48885, "end_ms": 51165, "text": "Who has obstructed you from obeying the truth?"}, {"start_ms": 51805, "end_ms": 54825, "text": "Such persuasion does not come from the One who calls you."}, {"start_ms": 55445, "end_ms": 58025, "text": "A little leaven works through the whole batch of dough."}, {"start_ms": 58705, "end_ms": 61526, "text": "I am confident in the Lord that you will take no other view."}, {"start_ms": 62206, "end_ms": 65546, "text": "The one who is troubling you will bear the judgment, whoever he may be."}, {"start_ms": 66546, "end_ms": 71467, "text": "Now, brothers, if I am still preaching circumcision, why am I still being persecuted?"}, {"start_ms": 72127, "end_ms": 74807, "text": "In that case the offense of the cross has been abolished."}, {"start_ms": 75447, "end_ms": 80307, "text": "As for those who are agitating you, I wish they would proceed to emasculate themselves!"}, {"start_ms": 80947, "end_ms": 86428, "text": "For you, brothers, were called to freedom; but do not use your freedom as an opportunity for the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 86948, "end_ms": 89308, "text": "Rather, serve one another in love."}, {"start_ms": 89948, "end_ms": 101349, "text": "The entire law is fulfilled in a single decree: “Love your neighbor as yourself.” But if you keep on biting and devouring one another, watch out, or you will be consumed by one another."}, {"start_ms": 102269, "end_ms": 107010, "text": "So I say, walk by the Spirit, and you will not gratify the desires of the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 107570, "end_ms": 112890, "text": "For the flesh craves what is contrary to the Spirit, and the Spirit what is contrary to the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 113591, "end_ms": 117231, "text": "They are opposed to each other, so that you do not do what you want."}, {"start_ms": 118151, "end_ms": 121551, "text": "But if you are led by the Spirit, you are not under the law."}, {"start_ms": 122371, "end_ms": 138693, "text": "The acts of the flesh are obvious: sexual immorality, impurity, and debauchery; idolatry and sorcery; hatred, discord, jealousy, and rage; rivalries, divisions, factions, and envy; drunkenness, orgies, and the like."}, {"start_ms": 139593, "end_ms": 145413, "text": "I warn you, as I did before, that those who practice such things will not inherit the kingdom of God."}, {"start_ms": 146474, "end_ms": 154974, "text": "But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, and self-control."}, {"start_ms": 155654, "end_ms": 157735, "text": "Against such things there is no law."}, {"start_ms": 158635, "end_ms": 163375, "text": "Those who belong to Christ Jesus have crucified the flesh with its passions and desires."}, {"start_ms": 164115, "end_ms": 167415, "text": "Since we live by the Spirit, let us walk in step with the Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 167916, "end_ms": 171696, "text": "Let us not become conceited, provoking and envying one another."}], "words": [{"t": "Galatians,", "s": 2060, "e": 2680, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2780, "e": 3060, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s": 3120, "e": 3520, "si": 0}, {"t": "It", "s": 4920, "e": 5000, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 5060, "e": 5200, "si": 1}, {"t": "for", "s": 5280, "e": 5421, "si": 1}, {"t": "freedom", "s": 5521, "e": 5901, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 6041, "e": 6161, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ", "s": 6221, "e": 6641, "si": 1}, {"t": "has", "s": 6701, "e": 6841, "si": 1}, {"t": "set", "s": 6901, "e": 7061, "si": 1}, {"t": "us", "s": 7101, "e": 7221, "si": 1}, {"t": "free.", "s": 7281, "e": 7501, "si": 1}, {"t": "Stand", "s": 7921, "e": 8281, "si": 2}, {"t": "firm,", "s": 8361, "e": 8621, "si": 2}, {"t": "then,", "s": 8701, "e": 8921, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 9101, "e": 9201, "si": 2}, {"t": "do", "s": 9261, "e": 9341, "si": 2}, {"t": "not", "s": 9481, "e": 9661, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 9701, "e": 9781, "si": 2}, {"t": "encumbered", "s": 9861, "e": 10401, "si": 2}, {"t": "once", "s": 10521, "e": 10721, "si": 2}, {"t": "more", "s": 10761, "e": 10961, "si": 2}, {"t": "by", "s": 11021, "e": 11161, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 11241, "e": 11261, "si": 2}, {"t": "yoke", "s": 11321, "e": 11541, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 11561, "e": 11621, "si": 2}, {"t": "slavery.", "s": 11701, "e": 12081, "si": 2}, {"t": "Take", "s": 12561, "e": 12761, "si": 3}, {"t": "notice:", "s": 12801, "e": 13161, "si": 3}, {"t": "I,", "s": 13841, "e": 13861, "si": 3}, {"t": "Paul,", "s": 13981, "e": 14321, "si": 3}, {"t": "tell", "s": 14441, "e": 14661, "si": 3}, {"t": "you", "s": 14701, "e": 14841, "si": 3}, {"t": "that", "s": 14921, "e": 15041, "si": 3}, {"t": "if", "s": 15081, "e": 15161, "si": 3}, {"t": "you", "s": 15221, "e": 15321, "si": 3}, {"t": "let", "s": 15401, "e": 1